OL,3,GNEWSATalk about suicide 'before it's
OL,4,Atoo late' says dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a young man who took his
OL,7,Fown life has urged parents to learn
OL,8,Fabout suicide "before it's too late".
OL,10,FJohn McGhee, whose son Max took his own
OL,11,Flife in 2017 aged 23, supports the
OL,12,FBristol-based charity Hope Against
OL,13,FSuicide (HAS), which has opened a pop
OL,14,Fup in the Cabot Circus shopping centre.
OL,16,FRates of suicide across England vary
OL,17,Fannually, with just over 5,700 deaths
OL,18,Frecorded in 2024, but rates in Bristol
OL,19,Fare about 3% higher than the national
OL,20,Faverage.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
