OL,3,GNEWSATalk about suicide 'before it's
OL,4,Atoo late' says dad
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm just a dad who learned too late
OL,7,Fthose skills but I want other mums and
OL,8,Fdads to learn before it's too late," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
